# Used only by `npm run build` (Vite inlines VITE_-prefixed vars at build
# time, not read at runtime) — npm run dev ignores this file and keeps
# using the empty-string default + vite.config.ts's dev proxy. See
# src/api/client.ts's docstring.
#
# V2 has no deployment of its own yet (see README.md's Deployment section —
# it's intentionally still on v2-dev, not merged to main). Left BLANK on
# purpose rather than pointing at V1's live paynexus-api.azurewebsites.net
# — V1 and V2 are different backends against different databases
# (paynexus vs paynexus_v2), so a V2 production build silently inheriting
# V1's URL would send V2 traffic at the wrong API entirely. Set this to
# V2's own backend URL once it actually has one.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
